{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"廣百論本","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"聖天菩薩造","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"唐三藏法師玄奘奉製譯","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破常品第一","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"一切爲果生　所以無常性　故除佛無有　如實號如來。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無有時方物　有性非緣生　故無時方物　有性而常住。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非無因有性．有因卽非常．故無因欲成　真見說非有。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"見所作無常　謂非作常住　旣見無常有　應言常性無。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"愚夫妄分別　謂空等爲常．智者依世間　亦不見此義。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非唯一有分　徧滿一切分　故知一一分　各別有有分。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法體實有　卷舒用可得　此定從[一]他生　故成所生果。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若離所生果　無有能生因　是故能生因　皆成所生果。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作地．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法必變異　方作餘生因　如是變異因　豈得名常住。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若本無今有　自然常爲因　旣許有自然　因則爲妄立。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"雲何依常性　而起於無常　因果相不同　世所未曾見。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若一分是因　餘分非因者　卽應成種種　種種故非常。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"在因微圓相　於果則非有　是故諸極微　非徧體和合。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"於一極微處　旣不許有餘　是故亦不應　許因果等量。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"微若有東方　必有東方分　極微若有分　如何是極微。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"要取前捨後　方得說爲行．此二若是無　行者應非有。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"極微無初分　中後分亦無　是則一切眼　皆所不能見。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若因爲果壞　是因卽非常　或許果與因　二體不同處。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"不見有諸法　常而是有對　故極微是常　諸佛未曾說。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"離縛所縛因　更無真解脫　生成用闕故　設有亦名無。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"究竟涅槃時　無藴亦無我　不見涅槃者　依何有涅槃。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我時捨諸德　離愛有何思．若有我無思　便[一]同無所有。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無餘有我種　則定能生思　要無我無思　諸有乃無有。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若離苦有我　則定無涅槃　是故涅槃中　我等皆永滅。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"寧在世間求　非求於勝義　以世間少有　於勝義都無。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破我品第二","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"內我實非男　非女非非二　但由無智故　謂我爲丈夫。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若諸大種中　無男女非二　雲何諸大種　有男等相生。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"汝我餘非我　故我無定相　豈不於無常　妄分別爲我。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我卽同於身　生生有變易　故離身有我　常住理不然。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法無觸對　則無有動搖　是故身作業　非命者能造。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我常非所害　豈煩修護因　誰恐食金剛　執仗防衆蠹。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作用．今依釋論及藏本改．","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若有宿生念　便謂我爲常　旣見昔時痕　身亦應常住。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若我與思合　轉成思念者　思亦應非思　故我非常住。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我與樂等合　種種如樂等　我如樂等故　非一亦非常。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若謂我思常　緣助成邪執　如言火常住　則不緣薪等。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"如至滅動物　作用彼無有．故有我無思　其理不成就。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"餘方起思界　別處見於思．如鐵鋌鎔銷　我體應變壞。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"思如意量小　我似虛空大　唯應觀自相　則不見於思。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我德若周徧　何爲他不受　能障旣言通　不應唯障一。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若德並非思　何能造一切　彼應與狂亂　俱癡無所成。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若德能善解　造舍等諸物　而不知受用　非理寧過此。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有動作無常　虛通無動作．無用同無性．何不欣無我。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"或觀我周徧　或見量同身　或執如極微．智者達非有。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"常法非可惱　何捨惱解脫　是故計我常　證解脫非理。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我若實有性　不應讚離我．定知真實者　趣解脫應虛。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"解脫中若無　前亦應非有．無雜時所見　彼真性應知。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若無常皆斷　草等何不然．此理設爲真　無明亦非有。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"現見色等行　從緣生住滅　故知汝執我　雖有而無用。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"如緣成[一]芽等　緣成種等生　故無常諸法　皆無常所起。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"以法從緣生　故體而無斷　以法從緣滅　故體亦非常。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破時品第三","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"瓶等在未來　卽非有過現．未來過現有　便是未來無。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"未來若已謝　而有未來體　此則恆未來　雲何成過現。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"法若在未來　現有未來相　應卽爲現在　如何名未來。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"去來如現有　取果用何無．若體恆非無　何爲不常住。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作牙．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"過去若過去　如何成過去．過去不過去　如何成過去。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"未來若有生　如何非現在．未來若無生　如何非常住。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若未來無生　壞故非常者　過去旣無壞　何不謂爲常。","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"現在世無常　非由過去等　除斯二所趣　更無有第三。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若後生諸行　[一]先已有定體　說有定性人　應非是邪執。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法因緣生　卽非先有體　先有而生者　生已復應生。","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若見去來有　如何不見無．旣見有去來　應不說爲遠。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"未作若法有　修戒等唐捐．若少有所爲　果則非先有。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸行旣無常　果則非恆有　若有初有後　世共許非常。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"應非勤解脫　解脫無去來．或許有去來　貪應離貪者。","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若執果先有　造宮舍嚴具　柱等則唐捐．果先無亦爾。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法有轉變　慧者未曾[二]知　唯除無智人　妄分別爲有。","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作生．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[二]原刻作有．今依釋論及藏本改．","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無常何有住　住無有何體．初若有住者　後應無變衰。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"譬如無一識　能了於二義　如是無一義　二識所能知。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"時若有餘住　住則不成時．時若餘住無　後滅應非有。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"法與無常異　法則非無常．法與無常一　法應非有住。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無常初旣劣　住力定應強　此二復何緣　後見成顛倒。","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若徧諸法體　無常力初劣　應都無有住　或一切皆常。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無常若恆有　住相應常無．或彼法先常　後乃非常住。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法無常俱　而言有住者　無常相應妄　或住相應虛。","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"無所見見無　迴心緣妄境　是故唯虛假　又憶念名生。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破見品第四","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"稟和希勝慧　是法器應知　異此有師資　無因獲勝利。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"說有及有因　淨與淨方便　世間自不了　過豈在牟尼。","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"捨諸有涅槃　邪宗所共許　真空破一切　如何彼不欣。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"不知捨證因　無由能捨證　是故牟尼說　清涼餘定無。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若於佛所說　深事以生疑　可依無相空　而生决定信。","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"觀現尚有妄　知後定爲虛．諸依彼法行　被誑終無已。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"智者自涅槃　是能作難作　愚夫逢善導　而無隨趣心。","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"不知無怖畏　徧知亦復然　定由少分知　而生於怖畏。","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"生死順流法　愚夫常習行　未曾修逆流　是故生怖畏。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸有愚癡人　障他真實見　無由生善趣　如何證涅槃。","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"寧毀犯尸羅　不損壞正見．尸羅生善趣　正見得涅槃。","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"寧彼起我執　非空無我見　後兼向惡趣　初唯背涅槃。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"空無我妙理　諸佛真境界　能怖衆惡見　涅槃不二門。","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"愚聞空法名　皆生大怖畏　如見大力者　怯劣悉奔逃。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸佛雖無心　說摧他論法　而他論自壞　如野火焚薪。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸有悟正法　定不樂邪宗　爲餘出僞門　故顯真空義。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若知佛所說　真空無我理　隨順不生欣　乖違無厭怖。","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"見諸外道衆　爲多無義因　樂正法有情　誰不深悲愍。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"婆羅門離繫　如來三所宗　耳眼意能知　故佛法深細。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"婆羅門所宗　多令行誑詐　離繫外道法　多分順愚癡。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]恭敬婆羅門　爲誦諸明故　愍念離繫者　由自苦其身。","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"如苦業所感　非真解脫因　勝身業所生　亦非證解脫。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"略言佛所說　具二別餘宗　不害生人天　觀空證解脫。","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"世人耽自宗　如愛本生地　正法能摧滅　邪黨不生欣。","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有智求勝德　應信受真宗　正法如日輪　有目因能見。","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破根境品第五","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作供．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"於瓶諸分中　可見唯是色　言瓶全可見　如何能悟真。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸有勝慧人　隨前所說義　於香味及觸　一切類應遮。","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若唯見瓶色　卽言見瓶者　旣不見香等　應名不見瓶。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有障礙諸色　體非全可見　彼分及中間　由此分所隔。","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"極微分有無　應審諦思察　引不成爲證　義終不可成。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"一切有礙法　皆衆分所成．言說字亦然　故非根所取。","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"離顯色有形　雲何取形色．卽顯取形色　何故不由身。","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"離色有色因　應非眼所見　二法體旣異　如何不別觀。","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"身覺於堅等　共立地等名　故唯於觸中　說地等差別。","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"瓶所見生時　不見有異德　體生如所見　故實性都無。","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"眼等皆大造　何眼見非餘．故業果難思　牟尼真實說。","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"智緣未有故　智非在見先　居後智唐捐　同時見無用。","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"眼若行至境　色遠見應遲　何不亦分明　照極遠近色。","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若見已方行　行卽爲無用　若不見而往　定欲見應無。","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若不往而觀　應見一切色　眼旣無行動　無遠亦無障。","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法體相用　前後定應同　如何此眼根　不見於眼性。","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"眼中無色識　識中無色眼　色內二俱無　何能合見色。","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"所聞若能表　何不成非音．聲若非能[一]詮　何故緣生解。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"聲若至耳聞　如何了聲本．聲無頓說理　如何全可知。","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"乃至非所聞　應非是聲性　先無而後有　理定不相應。","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"心若離諸根　去亦應無用．設如是命者　應常無有心。","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"令心妄取塵　依先見如燄　妄立諸法義　是想藴應知。","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"眼色等爲緣　如幻生諸識．若執爲實有　幻喻不應成。","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"世間諸所有　無不皆難測　根境理同然　智者何驚異。","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作證．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法如火輪　變化夢幻事　水月彗星響　陽燄及浮雲。","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破邊執品第六","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法若實有　應不依他成　旣必依他成　定知非實有。","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非卽色有瓶．非離色有瓶．非依瓶有色　非有瓶依色。","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若見二相異　謂離瓶有同　二相旣有殊　應離瓶有異。","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若一不名瓶　瓶應不名一．瓶一曾無合　瓶應無一名。","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若色徧於實　色應得大名　敵論若非他　應申自宗義。","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有數等能相　顯所相不成　除此更無因　故諸法非有。","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"離別相無瓶　故瓶體非一　一一非瓶故　瓶體亦非多。","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非無有觸體　與有觸體合　故色等諸法　不可合爲瓶。","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"色是瓶一分　故色體非瓶　有分旣爲無　一分如何有。","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"一切色等性　色等相無差　唯一類是瓶　餘非有何理。","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若色異味等　不異於瓶等　瓶等卽味等　色何卽瓶等。","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"瓶等旣無因　體應不成果　故若異色等　瓶等定爲無。","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"瓶等因若有　可爲瓶等因　瓶等因旣無　如何生瓶等。","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"色等和合時　終不成香等　故和合一體　應如瓶等無。","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"如離於色等　瓶體實爲無　色體亦應然　離風等非有。","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"煖卽是火性　非煖如何燒　故薪體爲無　離此火非有。","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"餘煖雜故成　如何不成火　若餘不成煖　由火法應無。","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若火微無薪　應離薪有火．火微有薪者　應無火極微。","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"審觀諸法時　無一體實有．一體旣非有　多體亦應無。","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法更無餘　汝謂爲一體　諸法皆三性　故一體爲無。","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有非有俱非　一非一雙泯　隨次應配屬　智者達非真。","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"於相續假法　惡見謂真常　積集假法中　邪執言實有。","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸法衆緣成　性羸無自在　虛假依他立　故我法皆無。","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"果衆緣合成　離緣無別果　如是合與果　諸聖達皆無。","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"識爲諸有種　境是識所行　見境無我時　諸有種皆滅。","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"破有爲相品第[一]七","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若本無而生　先無何不起．本有而生者　後有復應生。","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"果若能違因　先無不應理．果立因無用　先有亦不成。","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"此時非有生　彼時亦無生　此彼時無生　何時當有生。","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"如生於自性　生義旣爲無　於他性亦然　生義何成有。","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"初中後三位　生前定不成．二二旣爲無　一一如何有。","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非離於他性　唯從自性生　非從他及俱　故生定非有。","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"前後及同時　二俱不可說　故生與瓶等　唯假有非真。","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"舊若在新前　前生不應理　舊若居新後　後生理不成。","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻誤十．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"現非因現起　亦非因去來　未來亦不因　去來今世起。","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若具卽無來　旣滅應非往．法體相如是　幻等喻非虛。","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"生住滅三相　同時有不成　前後亦爲無　如何執爲有。","sortOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若生等諸相　復有別[一]生等　應住滅如生　或生住如滅。","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"所相異能相　何爲體非常．不異四應同　或復全非有。","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有不生有法　有不生無法　無不生有法　無不生無法。","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有不成有法　有不成無法　無不成有法　無不成無法。","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"半生半未生　非一生時體　或[二]已未生位　應亦是生時。","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"生時若是果　體卽非生時．生時若自然　應失生時性。","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"已生異未生　別有中間位　生時異二位　應別有中間。","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若謂生時捨　方得已生時　是則應有餘　得時而可見。","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若至已生位　理必無生時　已生有生時　雲何從彼起。","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻此二字作成位．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[二]原刻作以．今依釋論及藏本改．","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"未至已生位　若立爲生時　何不謂無瓶　未生無別故。","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"非生時有用　能簡未生時　亦非體未圓　別於已生位。","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"前位生時無　[一]後位方言有　兼成已生位　故此位非無。","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有時名已生　無時名未起　除茲有無位　誰復謂生時。","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸有執離因　無別所成果　轉生及轉滅　理皆不可成。","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"教誡弟子品第八","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"由少因緣故　[二]疑空謂不空　依前諸品中　理教應重遣。","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"能所說若有　空理則爲無．諸法假緣成　故三事非有。","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若唯說空過　不空義卽成　不空過已明　空義應先立。","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸欲壞他宗　必應成己義　何樂談他失　而無立己宗。","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"爲破一等執　假立遣爲宗　他三執旣除　自宗隨不立。","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"許瓶爲現見　空因非有能　餘宗現見因　此宗非所許。","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作方．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[二]原刻作凝．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若無不空理　空理如何成．汝旣不立空　不空應不立。","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若許有無宗　有宗方可立　無宗若非有　有宗應不成。","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若諸法皆空　如何火名煖　此如前具遣　火煖俗非真。","sortOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若謂法實有　遮彼說爲空　應四論皆真　見何過而捨。","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若諸法都無　生死應非有　諸佛何曾許　執法定爲無。","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若真離有無　何緣言俗有　汝本宗亦爾　致難復何爲。","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]諸法若都無　差別應非有　執諸法皆有　差別亦應無。","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若謂法非有　無能破有因　破有因已明　汝宗何不立。","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"說破因易得　是世俗虛言　汝何緣不能　遮破真空義。","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有名詮法有　謂法實非無　無名表法無　法實應非有。","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"由名解法有　遂謂法非無　因名知法無　應信法非有。","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"諸世間可說　皆是假非真　離世俗名言　乃是真非假。","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"[一]原刻作非．今依麗刻及藏本改．","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"謗諸法爲無　可墮於無見　唯蠲諸妄執　如何說墮無。","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有非真有故　無亦非真無　旣無有真無　何有於真有。","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有因證法空　法空應不立.宗因無異故　因體實爲無。","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"謂空喻別有　例諸法非空　惟有喻應成　內我同烏黑。","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"若法本性空　見空有何德.虛妄分別縛　證空見能除。","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"法成一成無　違真亦違俗　故與有一異　二俱不可言。","sortOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"有非有俱非　諸宗皆寂滅　於中欲興難　畢竟不能申。","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"聖天菩薩造論旣周重敘摧邪復說頌曰.","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"我在爲燎邪宗火　沃以如來正教酥　又扇因明廣大風　誰敢如蛾投猛燄。","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_289_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_289","text":"廣百論本〈梵本二百頌〉","sortOrder":254}],"overrides":{}}